20 watts or not less than 10 watts per 100 seats, whichever is greater.  Special 
consideration will be given to acoustics, speaker placement, and the functions 
for which the system will be used, particularly for large auditoriums where 
music will be reproduced or amplified.</NPR><BRK/>
