<BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/><BRL/></TAB></TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>MICROPHONE INPUT MODULES</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Verify that the designated number of inputs are sufficient to meet the 
requirements of the design and increase the number of inputs if required.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Microphone input modules must as a minimum conform to the following specifications:</TXT><BRK/>
<TXT><TAB HEADERROWS="0">
<WBK>
